<PublicShell
  title="About AntiquesID"
  description="AntiquesID is an AI-powered antique identification and collector knowledge platform."
>
<div style="background:#EFE7D9;min-height:60vh;">
  <div style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:80px 32px;">
    <p style="font-family:'Prata',Georgia,serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C8A060;margin-bottom:24px;">About</p>
    <h1 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Didot,Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,56px);font-weight:400;color:#1C1810;margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.1;">AntiquesID</h1>
    <div style="font-family:'Prata',Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9;color:#3C3028;">
      <p>AntiquesID is an antique identification and collector knowledge platform. We help collectors, dealers, and curious minds identify objects, understand their value, and learn their history.</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;color:#1C1810;margin:40px 0 12px;">Editorial Standards</h2>
      <p>Every guide and article on AntiquesID is reviewed before publication. We draw on specialist knowledge across ceramics, glass, jewellery, furniture, art, metalware, and all major antiques categories. We correct errors promptly.</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;color:#1C1810;margin:40px 0 12px;">Who We Are</h2>
      <p>AntiquesID is part of the GAUK Network, a portfolio of specialist digital publications based in New Zealand.</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;color:#1C1810;margin:40px 0 12px;">Contact</h2>
      <p>For editorial enquiries use our <a href="https://preferences.gaukmedia.com/contact" style="color:#7A5C20;">contact form</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
